39
00:04:35,264 --> 00:04:43,904
Generative AI refers to a type of artificial intelligence designed to create new content, such as text, images, music, and videos.

40
00:04:44,144 --> 00:04:54,144
Unlike traditional AI, which analyzes or categorizes data, generative AI produces original content based on patterns learned from vast data sets.

41
00:04:54,384 --> 00:04:57,824
Essentially, it generates new unique material.

42
00:04:58,064 --> 00:05:04,784
These models are often trained on large amounts of data and use sophisticated algorithms to mimic human creativity.

43
00:05:05,024 --> 00:05:14,064
Tools like ChatGPT or DALI can create art, write essays, or simulate conversations by generating outputs based on user prompts.

44
00:05:14,384 --> 00:05:18,704
Generative AI has a wide range of applications, content creation.

45
00:05:18,944 --> 00:05:25,344
Tools like GPT-4 generate text, blog posts, stories, and essays from simple prompts.

46
00:05:25,664 --> 00:05:26,944
Art and Design.

47
00:05:27,264 --> 00:05:35,184
AI models such as DALI generate unique images and designs based on text descriptions, transforming creativity in art.

48
00:05:35,744 --> 00:05:37,264
Music and audio.

49
00:05:37,584 --> 00:05:44,224
AI can compose music or replicate voices, offering new possibilities for musicians and audio engineers.

50
00:05:44,544 --> 00:05:45,504
Healthcare.

51
00:05:45,824 --> 00:05:53,984
Generative AI simulates disease progression or creates synthetic medical data, helping doctors gain faster insights for research.

52
00:05:54,224 --> 00:05:59,264
Let's take image generation as an example to explain how generative AI works.

53
00:05:59,984 --> 00:06:02,064
Data collection and learning.

54
00:06:02,304 --> 00:06:07,984
AI models like DALI are trained on large datasets of images paired with text descriptions.

55
00:06:08,144 --> 00:06:15,744
These datasets teach the model to recognize different objects, colors, styles, and how to associate text with corresponding images.

56
00:06:15,984 --> 00:06:22,624
The more data the AI learns from, the better it can generate accurate and diverse images based on user prompts.

57
00:06:22,944 --> 00:06:25,344
Neural networks and transformers.

58
00:06:25,664 --> 00:06:37,504
When Emma inputs a prompt like a cat wearing sunglasses, the transformer model processes the text, recognizing words like cat and sunglasses, and links them to images it learned from during training.

59
00:06:37,824 --> 00:06:43,184
Transformers help the AI decide how to combine these elements into a coherent image.

60
00:06:43,504 --> 00:06:45,184
Tokens and context.

61
00:06:45,424 --> 00:06:51,104
The text input, such as a cat wearing sunglasses, is split into smaller parts called tokens.

62
00:06:51,344 --> 00:06:55,184
The AI processes each token and understands their relationship.

63
00:06:55,424 --> 00:07:02,384
For instance, it knows the sunglasses should be placed on the cat, creating a contextually accurate image.

64
00:07:02,784 --> 00:07:04,384
Feedback mechanism.

65
00:07:04,704 --> 00:07:07,824
Generative AI models improve through feedback.

66
00:07:08,064 --> 00:07:13,184
After generating an image, users provide feedback on the accuracy or quality of the output.

67
00:07:13,344 --> 00:07:19,184
If Emma's generated image shows the sunglasses floating beside the cat, she can mark it as incorrect.

68
00:07:19,344 --> 00:07:23,264
The model uses this feedback to improve future image generations.

69
00:07:23,904 --> 00:07:25,664
Reinforcement learning.

70
00:07:25,984 --> 00:07:29,264
Reinforcement learning further enhances the AI's ability.

71
00:07:29,504 --> 00:07:34,544
The model is rewarded when it generates accurate images and corrected when it makes mistakes.

72
00:07:34,784 --> 00:07:42,784
For example, when Emma describes a sunset and the AI produces a vibrant sunset image, it receives positive reinforcement.

73
00:07:43,024 --> 00:07:47,664
Over time, this method refines the model's ability to generate better images.

74
00:07:48,064 --> 00:07:50,544
Data science and AI models.

75
00:07:50,864 --> 00:07:56,624
Data scientists curate the training data and define the parameters that help the AI generate accurate images.

76
00:07:56,864 --> 00:08:02,224
The more varied the data set, the more versatile the AI becomes in generating diverse types of content.

77
00:08:02,464 --> 00:08:09,424
Advanced models use billions of parameters, which are settings that guide the AI in processing data and generating outputs.

78
00:08:09,744 --> 00:08:11,744
