2068
03:27:06,640 --> 03:27:13,760
It is a measure of decrease in entropy after the data set is split, also known as entropy reduction.

2069
03:27:14,240 --> 03:27:16,000
Information gain should be high.

2070
03:27:16,206 --> 03:27:20,320
So we want our information that we get out of the split to be as high as possible.

