03:27:20,686 --> 03:27:24,000
Let's take a look at entropy from the mathematical side.

2072
03:27:24,302 --> 03:27:37,440
In this case, we're going to denote entropy as i of p of n, where p is the probability that you're going to play a game of golf, and n is the probability where you're not going to play the game of golf.

2073
03:27:37,678 --> 03:27:39,760
Now you don't really have to memorize these formulas.

